      <tei:div type="colophon" subtype="notes">
        <tei:p>This is a qinah piyyut for the victims of the Holocaust by Shlomo Fundaminsky, edited by Abraham Rosenfeld and included in the latter’s <tei:hi rend="italic">Authorised Selichot for the Whole Year</tei:hi> (1956) in the section on seliḥot for the Fast of Tevet. The specific edits made by Rosenfeld aren’t clear, but the inclusion of his name as an acrostic signature suggests that at least some (besides the acrostic) were substantial.</tei:p>
      </tei:div>
      <j:endConditional target="#osp_69567_notes"/>
